Text0 = Array[String](["Dang, I been sitting here for hours and only catched a measly grapefish!", "I gotta say, the west side has way better catches", "...Oh, good day to you", "Are you planning to jump off to the east here?", "Well I don't think it's a really good idea", "Through the clouds I've seen some weird floating hands moving at huge speeds there"])
